claim.claim-text:
a base unit housing a motor and a pump;
a removable reservoir supported by the base unit;
a handle connected to the base unit and fluidly coupled to the pump by a hose; and
a pressure assembly connected to the base unit and configured to allow a user to selectively adjust the pressure output of the oral irrigator, the pressure assembly including a gear, a rack arranged to move laterally relative to a rack bracket, wherein the rack includes a plurality of teeth configured to be engaged with teeth on the gear, and an actuator, the actuator connected to the rack and configured to move the rack in a lateral direction to actuate the gear.
